41411::$$$message_0294_0000_0000$$$::"These are Sella and Leysritt's swimsuits."::
41412::$$$message_0294_0001_0000$$$::"Oh? They look better in them than I expected.[lr]::
41413::$$$message_0294_0001_0001$$$::We can finally tell their hairstyles apart. Some people might be very happy about that."::
41414::$$$message_0294_0002_0000$$$::"'Pay attention to Sella's small boobs,' they said! The nerve!"::
41415::$$$message_0294_0003_0000$$$::"...Why are you upset? [cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01h(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01h(中)]Why not just laugh it off? [cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01c(中)]Hmm.[lr]::
41416::$$$message_0294_0003_0001$$$::To be honest, I grow weary of these body proportion discussions, but this is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity, so let's thoroughly[line len=2]"::
41417::$$$message_0294_0004_0000$$$::"Go [wait canskip=0 time=200]to [se storage=se114.wav][wait canskip=0 time=100][se storage=se114.wav]hell! [delay speed=user][wait canskip=0 time=300][br][se storage=se114.wav][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][move textoff=0 time=150 path=(100,0,255)(-41,0,255)(-20,0,255) storage=凛巫女服02c(中)b accel=0][se storage=se230.wav][move textoff=0 time=150 path=(-116,0,255)(-203,0,255)(-352,0,255)(-522,0,255) storage=アーチャー神主01j(中)b accel=0] Just die, already!"[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=400][se storage=se155.wav][quake time=1000 vmax=30 hmax=20][wait canskip=0 time=800]::

